  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB00101",
    "sub_id": "31197",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "學生應積極參與所有以英語進行的課堂活動。規律出席與準時上課是必要的，因為持續的語言接觸是英文能力提升的關鍵。所有作業需按時繳交；若逾期繳交，除非事先獲得批准，否則可能會被扣分。\n\n本課程嚴格遵守學術誠信原則。任何形式的抄襲、作弊或未經授權的合作皆不被允許，並可能導致校方的處分。所有作業須正確引用並清楚標明資料來源。\n\n課堂上應保持尊重的交流態度與積極的學習心態。學生需共同營造一個支持性的學習環境，將錯誤視為學習的機會。遵守這些規範，學生將能穩步進步，並充分受益於全英語的學習環境。",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
    "ais_meno_en": "<div><strong>Academic Integrity Statement and Course Description</strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>This course is designed to provide students with a fully immersive English environment, where communication, discussion, and learning take place entirely in English. By engaging with course materials, interactive tasks, and peer collaboration, students are encouraged to develop their language skills naturally and progressively. The aim is not only to improve grammar, vocabulary, and comprehension, but also to build confidence in using English in both academic and practical contexts. Through consistent exposure, students will gradually enhance their fluency and critical thinking in English.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>At the same time, academic integrity is a fundamental principle of this course. Students are expected to complete all assignments and assessments honestly, ensuring that their work reflects personal effort and genuine understanding. Plagiarism, cheating, or misuse of digital or AI tools is not permitted. Proper acknowledgment of sources must always be observed. By maintaining integrity, students protect the fairness of the learning environment and the value of their progress.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>This course therefore combines two key elements: an English-only setting that fosters long-term language improvement, and a commitment to honesty and responsibility that ensures meaningful academic growth.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
